[[File:Mos_Eisley.png|thumb|right|350px|Mos Eisley, a spaceport settlement on Tatooine.]]
'''Spaceports''',<ref name="Episode IV" /> also known as '''starports''',<ref name="Droids in Distress">{{Rebels|Droids in Distress}}</ref> were facilities where [[starship]]s and other spacecraft would dock and take off from. [[Mos Eisley]] was a spaceport settlement on the [[desert]] [[planet]] of [[Tatooine]].<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref> Starports were grouped in three classes: stellar, standard, and limited services.<ref name="Bomber Command">''[[The Last Jedi: Bomber Command]]''</ref> [[Baggage-robo]]s were a type of [[droid]] that helped passengers with bulky luggage and were often found at starports.<ref name="Galactic Survival Skills">''[[Star Wars: How Not to Get Eaten by Ewoks and Other Galactic Survival Skills]]''</ref>

